        "explanation": "Doctor interprets '出院后3天' correctly as starting from discharge day, not from today, resolving the family's confusion about the 3-day calculation.",
        "quote": "“出院后3天”是从出院当天开始算，不是从今天重新起算3天。"
      }
    ],
    "continuity_memory_focus": [
