        "explanation": "Doctor asks the family to provide drug box information, contacts the original ward, and prepares a simple home-execution plan for the elder caregiver.",
        "quote": "请您把孩子目前手头正在用的雾化药，按药盒/药袋上的字逐字发给我"
      }
    ]
  },

