          "explanation": "Doctor asks about fever, cough, breathing, cyanosis, mental status, intake, and provides emergency thresholds.",
          "quote": "目前病情上最该盯的是这些：\n- 又发烧\n- 咳嗽明显加重或喘\n- 呼吸比平时快、费力、胸口凹陷\n- 精神差、吃喝明显变少\n- 嘴唇发青"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC1 is met because the doctor elicited and acted on the child's current near-term respiratory and systemic status and provided clear red-flag thresholds.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC1",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00016",
