          "quote": "肺实变和少量胸腔积液不一定马上完全消, 但需要按时复查"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 is met; the doctor recognized that discharge diagnoses require follow-up and did not equate symptom improvement with complete recovery.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00058",
          "explanation": "Doctor refuses to guess nebulization details from blurry sources and directs the family to verify with original discharge unit.",
          "quote": "我今天只能确认你们手头有“吸入用布地奈德混悬液 1mg/2ml”，但不能仅凭常规经验替代孩子这次出院后的具体医嘱"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 is met; the doctor treated the blurry medication information as a critical gap and directed verification without guessing doses.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00125",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly distinguishes ibuprofen as an antipyretic not for routine use and separates it from nebulization and antibiotics.",
          "quote": "布洛芬没发烧就不用吃"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC4 is met; the doctor differentiated medication roles and warned against routine ibuprofen use.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [],
      "explanation": "RC5 requires converting verified medication and monitoring information into an executable home plan for multiple caregivers, including a written log or checklist. The doctor verbally instructed the family and gave a simple phrase for the elder, but never created or recommended a shared, written, auditable record (e.g., a medication log with fields for drug, time, symptoms, and person) and did not probe whether the elder was using a different or conflicting plan. This is a minor omission that partially meets the letter but not the spirit of RC5.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC5",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00058",
          "explanation": "Doctor specifies who to contact (original ward/nurse station), what materials to bring (drug boxes, discharge papers), and the timing (within days to one week).",
          "quote": "今天尽快联系原出院科室/病区护士站 … 建议这两天到一周内安排线下复诊"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC6 is met; the doctor provided a concrete follow-up pathway with owner, materials, and timing.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
